  "description": "*\"I came to get plastic surgery.\"\n\"I refuse.\"*\nThe world's first plastic surgeon refusing to do plastic surgery?!\nPlastic surgeon Jin-Su, is a fanboy of idol Ju-Ho who owns the \"perfect face\". One day someone with the same face as Ju-Ho comes to the plastic surgery clinic?! But it isn't Ju-Ho, but his twin brother Min-Ho? Jin-Su who is caught between the twin brothers! What does the future hold for him? \n\n(Source: Peanutoon, translated)",
